## 🛠️ Technologies Used

| S.No | Technology | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| 1 | HTML5 | Webpage structure |
| 2 | CSS3 | Styling and designing |
| 3 | CSS Grid | Product arrangement |
| 4 | Media Queries | Responsive design |

